{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Adjoin.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.NAry","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Factorial.Basic"],"declarations":28,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_unique_of_adjoin_eq_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_unique_of_adjoin_eq_top","kind":"theorem","line":386,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L386-L396","doc":"**Uniqueness on a generated algebra.** If `s₀, …, s_{N-1}` generate `A`, the Markov\nconditions determine `t` completely. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_unique","kind":"theorem","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L337-L384","doc":"**Markov-trace uniqueness on `H_{n+1}`, for every `n`.** Let `t, t'` be `R`-linear\nfunctionals on `A` that are normalised (`t 1 = 1`), cyclic, and satisfy the Markov\nproperty with the same parameter `z` at every level below `N`:\n`t (x · s_k) = z · t x` for `x` in the subalgebra generated by `s₀, …, s_{k-1}`, `k < N`.\nThen `t` and `t'` agree on the subalgebra generated by `s₀, …, s_{n-1}` for every\n`n ≤ N`. (`t (s₀) = z` is the case `k = 0`, `x = 1`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_peel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_peel","kind":"theorem","line":318,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L318-L335","doc":"**Markov reduction of a normal-form word.** For a cyclic functional with the\nMarkov property at level `n`, the trace of `y · s_n · dprod s j m'` (`j + m' = n`,\n`y` at level `n`) is `z` times the trace of the level-`n` element\n`dprod s j m' · y`. This is the step that lowers the level by one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.adjoin_eq_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.adjoin_eq_level","kind":"theorem","line":300,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L300-L308","doc":"**The spanning theorem (Jones normal form).** For `n ≤ N`, the subalgebra generated\nby `s₀, …, s_{n-1}` is spanned by the at most `(n+1)!` Jones normal-form words\n`words s n` (`card_words_le`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.words_subset_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.words_subset_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":276,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L276-L298","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_mul_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_mul_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L259-L274","doc":"The level-`n` span is closed under right multiplication by every element of the\nsubalgebra generated by `s₀, …, s_{n-1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_mul_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_mul_gen","kind":"theorem","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L240-L257","doc":"**Closure.** For `n ≤ N`, the span of the level-`n` words is closed under right\nmultiplication by `s₀, …, s_{n-1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mul_gen_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mul_gen_mem","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L210-L238","doc":"The case analysis: a single summand `y · dprod s j m` times a generator `sᵢ`\n(`i ≤ n`) stays in the span of the level-`(n+1)` words. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_mem_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_mem_level","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L199-L204","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_le_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level_le_succ","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L195-L197","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.one_mem_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.one_mem_level","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L191-L193","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mem","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L183-L189","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mem_words","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.mul_dprod_mem_words","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L175-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.level","kind":"def","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L171-L173","doc":"The span of the level-`n` words. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.card_words_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.card_words_le","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L156-L168","doc":"**The word count**: at most `(n+1)!` words at level `n` (`= |S_{n+1}|`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.words","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.words","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L149-L154","doc":"The Jones normal-form words at level `n` (in `s₀, …, s_{n-1}`):\n`words 0 = {1}`, `words (n+1) = { x · dprod s j (n+1-j) : x ∈ words n, j ≤ n+1 }`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_push","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_push","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L115-L142","doc":"A generator above the foot passes through the run with its index lowered by one:\n`dprod s j m * s_{i+1} = s_i * dprod s j m` for `j ≤ i`, `i + 2 ≤ j + m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.comm_dprod_high","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.comm_dprod_high","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L104-L113","doc":"A generator strictly above the run (by at least two) commutes past it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.comm_dprod_low","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.comm_dprod_low","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L93-L102","doc":"A generator strictly below the run commutes past it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_succ'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_succ'","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L82-L87","doc":"Peeling the run from the foot: `dprod s j (m+1) = dprod s (j+1) m * s j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_succ","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L80-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod_zero","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L78-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.dprod","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L73-L76","doc":"The descending run `dprod s j m = s_{j+m-1} ⋯ s_{j+1} s_j` (`m` letters). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.comm","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.braid","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.quad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.quad","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily.mk","kind":"ctor","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.HeckeFamily","kind":"structure","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalForm.lean#L66-L71","doc":"Type-`A` Hecke relations on the first `N` members of a family `s : ℕ → A`,\nwith an arbitrary quadratic relation `sᵢ² = a·sᵢ + b`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}